### Create user (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "franko@mail.com",
  "displayName": "Franko",
  "timezone": "America/New_York"
}

### Create grade component (201). Total weight per subject can't pass 100 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/subjects/{{subjectId}}/grade-components
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Midterm",
  "category": "MIDTERM",
  "weightPercent": 30
}

### List grade components
GET http://localhost:8080/subjects/{{subjectId}}/grade-components

### Update grade component weight
PATCH http://localhost:8080/grade-components/{{componentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weightPercent": 25
}
